          "As a Medical Oncologist, one of the questions I frequently receive from breastfeeding mothers is, “Can Breast Pump Cause Cancer?” My answer is always based on scientific evidence rather than myths or assumptions. Simply put, the answer is no . There is no medical or scientific evidence to show that using a breast pump increases the risk of breast cancer. Despite the widespread concern, years of research have consistently demonstrated that Can Breast Pump Cause Cancer is a myth—not a medical fact.",
