          "As we have already discussed, the scientific evidence clearly answers “Can Breast Pump Cause Cancer?” with a firm no . Yet, this question continues to worry many mothers. In my clinical practice, I often find that these fears are not based on medical evidence but on temporary breast changes experienced during breastfeeding and the spread of misinformation online. Understanding why this misconception exists is important to help mothers make informed decisions instead of living with unnecessary anxiety.",
