          "Throughout this article, I have explained that the answer to “Can Breast Pump Cause Cancer?” is no . Scientific evidence clearly shows that breast pumps do not increase the risk of breast cancer. However, while mothers should not worry about pumping causing cancer, they should never ignore persistent breast changes that could indicate an underlying problem. Early detection remains one of the most important factors in successful breast cancer treatment. According to the American Cancer Society , when breast cancer is diagnosed at an early, localized stage, the 5-year relative survival rate exceeds 99% . This highlights why recognizing warning signs is far more important than worrying about the myth that Can Breast Pump Cause Cancer .",
