          "You should also be alert to changes in the size, shape, or appearance of one breast . A breast that suddenly appears swollen, distorted, or develops nipple inversion without an obvious breastfeeding-related cause should always be examined. Although hormonal changes during pregnancy and lactation naturally affect breast size, persistent or one-sided changes should never be ignored.",
